usiness_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","review_id":"GZVvWNHGWJonW_ctCOaCCA","date":"2015-03-22T03:33:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9500460624694824,"text_excerpt":"Pizza Domenica! Yay! This is my first time at the new offset location. I've always originally gone to Domenica downtown. The happy hour is the best time to go. Every single day, you can get half off pizzas! Isn't that the best? I love the one with the egg -- I forget what it's called but there's only one on the menu with it. Today I went for happy hour, of course. We ordered the Tutto Carne and the Clam. The Tutto Carne is like your classic meat lovers. The thing is, you can actually taste the freshness of the ingredients. From the dough, to the minimal sauce, to the meats, and the cheese (from St. James)!!!! What isn't there to love? The Clam is also one of my favorites. It was delicious..."},{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","review_id":"CglY8inHxV7hjw2LT_IkfA","date":"2017-04-28T19:11:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9430564641952515,"text_excerpt":"One of the best pizza places in the city. We tried the margarita, the prosciutto, and the tutto (kind of like a meat lovers). We also got some burrata and garlic knots with the whipped provolone. I will say the appetizers blew me away. The happy hour is amazing. Half off all pizzas! Check this place out!"},{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","review_id":"4uWTJHCRmqcjYOxVz75hvQ","date":"2017-03-02T21:40:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9430195093154907,"text_excerpt":"Yesssss. Before I write anything- Just order the garlic knots with the fonduta cheese stuff---and thank me later... It's extremely carb-y, and cheese-y and rich and filling... but it's just so good. Come for the happy hour because it's half price pizzas! and the pizzas are delicious! I believe they also do half price wine for happy hour. A little bit pricey for pizza when it's not happy hour, but the ingredients are quality. Service has always been adequate and I've really liked everything I've had here. The Chef is the same guy as Shaya (which if you've eaten there and enjoyed it, you will enjoy this) Word to the wise-- I have ordered take out pizzas here several times and always been a ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","photo_id":"LV1R86r9cQSF-lrtWC2t-w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/LV1R86r9cQSF-lrtWC2t-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8985164761543274},{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","photo_id":"LzV-V8n5eDOcw-hBHoXLkQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LzV-V8n5eDOcw-hBHoXLkQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.878091037273407},{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","photo_id":"Elht-qOhVGVgGjo98tjnWw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Elht-qOhVGVgGjo98tjnWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8701983094215393},{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","photo_id":"cpvT7hNnbrwCEbzSN06IwQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/cpvT7hNnbrwCEbzSN06IwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8580918908119202},{"business_id":"eLjXnfYwkr8zz0VhwMhOGw","photo_id":"zuwjhhCLYJNRQoN_hfazxA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zuwjhhCLYJNRQoN_hfazxA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.853885293006897}]},"notebook_case":null}
